OL,3,GNEWSAThree heart attacks will not stop
OL,4,Avolunteer at 90
OL,5,
OL,6,F"What makes you feel good and full of
OL,7,Flife is when a little lad in Gambia
OL,8,Fsays 'Ooo, that tastes lovely. What a
OL,9,Fbeautiful taste.' That makes it
OL,10,Fworthwhile."
OL,12,FDavid Rawson says three heart attacks
OL,13,Fhave not stopped him from helping to
OL,14,Fmake hand-operated water filters that
OL,15,Fare sent to disaster zones around the
OL,16,Fworld.
OL,18,FThe 90-year-old, from Bakewell in
OL,19,FDerbyshire, has volunteered at Aquabox
OL,20,Fin nearby Cromford for 27 years and was
OL,21,Fawarded the British Empire Medal for
OL,22,Fhis efforts.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
