OL,3,GNEWSAThree heart attacks will not stop
OL,4,Avolunteer at 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe joins the charity's production line
OL,7,Ftwice a week, most recently helping
OL,8,Ffill a shipment heading for Nepal that
OL,9,Fwill provide clean drinking water for
OL,10,Fup to 26,000 people.
